# Shifting <%= Basket.model_name.human(count: 2) %> During Absences

You can now move the contents of absent <%= Basket.model_name.human(count: 2).downcase %> to another delivery without changing the number of invoiced <%= Basket.model_name.human(count: 2).downcase %>.

This function is only accessible to admins by default. You can make it accessible to members by modifying [the absence settings](/settings#absence).

Two new [automatic email templates](/mail_templates?scope=absence) about absences have also been added to improve communication with members.

Find more information about this feature in [the absence handbook](/handbook/absence#basket-shift).
